DHMI-WHO-EUR Reproducibility Package — Dual licence

This repository is released under a dual-licence scheme:

  * All software (R scripts, shell scripts, configuration files) is licensed
    under the MIT License (Section A below).
  * All data products derived by the authors (processed scores, cluster
    assignments, indicator dictionary, recoded indicator values) are licensed
    under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    Licence (Section B below).

The original WHO Regional Office for Europe 2023 survey data redistributed in
this repository remain subject to the licensing terms of the World Health
Organization. Users are required to retain the WHO source attribution as
indicated in the README.

