---------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHO SOURCE DATA — separate licensing
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The raw WHO 2023 Regional Survey indicators (file: data/raw/WHO_2023_survey_raw.csv)
are reproduced under the open data terms of the World Health Organization
Regional Office for Europe. Citation:

  World Health Organization. (2023). The ongoing journey to commitment and
  transformation: digital health in the WHO European Region. WHO Regional
  Office for Europe.

  Available at:
  https://www.who.int/europe/publications/i/item/WHO-EURO-2023-8150-48388-71429

Users redistributing or building upon the raw WHO data should consult the
WHO licensing terms directly.
